sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client
    participant Router as FastAPI Router
    participant Manager as Manager Agent
    participant Tool as Tool Agent<br/>(LangGraph)
    participant MCP as OXII MCP Server
    participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Pro

    Note over User,LLM: Case 2: Device List Query "Show me all devices"<br/>Flow: Manager → Tool Agent → MCP Server → Response<br/>Total Time: ~14.21s

    %% === REQUEST PHASE ===
    User->>Client: "Show me all devices"
    Client->>+Router: POST /ai/chat/text<br/>{message: "Show me all devices",<br/>sessionId: "testing1234"}
    Note over Router: 2025-11-02 03:32:25

    %% === MANAGER ROUTING ===
    Router->>+Manager: Process request
    Note over Manager: Load conversation context
    
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Manager,LLM: 🔍 ANALYZE & ROUTE
        Manager->>+LLM: Analyze query with history
        Note over LLM: Analyzing intent...<br/>⏱️ ~3.5s
        LLM-->>-Manager: {<br/>  agent_type: "tool",<br/>  confidence: 1.00,<br/>  reasoning: "User asking for<br/>  device information"<br/>}
        Note over Manager: 🎯 Routing decision: tool
    end

    Manager->>+Tool: delegate to ToolAgent<br/>{input: "Show me all devices",<br/> token: "testing123..."}
    Note over Tool: 🔧 Tool Agent loaded<br/>⏱️ MCP init: ~1s

    %% === TOOL AGENT INITIALIZATION ===
    rect rgb(220, 240, 220)
        Note over Tool,MCP: 🌐 MCP CLIENT SETUP
        Tool->>+MCP: Connect SSE<br/>https://mockup-mcp.onrender.com/sse
        MCP-->>Tool: session_id generated
        MCP-->>-Tool: 7 tools loaded:<br/>• get_device_list<br/>• switch_on_off_controls_v2<br/>• ac_controls_mesh_v2<br/>• room_one_touch_control<br/>• etc.
        Note over Tool: ✅ MCP tools initialized
    end

    %% === TOOL AGENT REASONING ===
    rect rgb(240, 230, 220)
        Note over Tool,LLM: 🧠 REASONING PHASE (Iteration 0)
        
        Note over Tool: __start__ node<br/>Initialize state
        
        Tool->>Tool: reason_node (LangGraph)
        Note over Tool: Build messages with<br/>TOOL_PROMPT + user input
        
        Tool->>+LLM: Invoke with tools bound<br/>SystemMessage: TOOL_PROMPT<br/>HumanMessage: "Show me all devices"
        Note over LLM: Gemini analyzing<br/>with MCP tool schemas...<br/>⏱️ ~3s
        LLM-->>-Tool: AIMessage {<br/>  tool_calls: [{<br/>    name: "get_device_list",<br/>    args: {token: "OXII-TOKEN"}<br/>  }]<br/>}
        
        Note over Tool: 🔧 Tool calls planned: 1<br/>→ get_device_list
    end

    %% === TOOL EXECUTION ===
    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)
        Note over Tool,MCP: ⚙️ EXECUTION PHASE
        
        Tool->>Tool: execute_node<br/>Categorize tools:<br/>• Prerequisites: get_device_list<br/>• Independent: none
        
        Note over Tool: 📋 Phase 2a: Execute<br/>prerequisite tool sequentially
        
        Tool->>+MCP: Create fresh MCP client<br/>for get_device_list
        MCP-->>-Tool: Client ready
        
        Tool->>+MCP: call_tool("get_device_list",<br/>  {token: "testing1231234"})
        Note over MCP: Query OXII API<br/>⏱️ ~1.5s
        MCP-->>-Tool: Device list JSON:<br/>[{<br/>  house_id: 1,<br/>  room_id: 101,<br/>  room_name: "Phòng khách",<br/>  devices: [...],<br/>  buttons: [{<br/>    buttonId: 1001,<br/>    name: "Quạt điện",<br/>    type: "FAN",<br/>    status: "tắt"<br/>  }, ...]<br/>}]
        
        Note over Tool: ✅ get_device_list completed<br/>🧹 Cleaned up MCP client
        
        Tool->>Tool: Add ToolMessage to history
    end

    %% === FINAL RESPONSE GENERATION ===
    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        Note over Tool,LLM: 📝 SYNTHESIZE RESPONSE
        
        Tool->>Tool: reason_node (Iteration 1)
        
        Tool->>+LLM: Invoke with tool results<br/>Messages: [System, Human,<br/>  AI(tool_calls), ToolMessage(results)]
        Note over LLM: Generate natural response<br/>based on device data<br/>⏱️ ~4s
        LLM-->>-Tool: AIMessage {<br/>  content: "Based on the information<br/>  from your home, here are<br/>  the devices I found:<br/><br/>  **Phòng khách**<br/>  - 🌀 Quạt điện (FAN) - Status: tắt<br/>  - ❄️ Điều hòa (CONDITIONER) - Status: tắt"<br/>}
        
        Note over Tool: ✅ Final answer ready:<br/>No more tool_calls<br/>output = response.content
    end

    Tool-->>-Manager: {<br/>  output: "Based on the information...",<br/>  success: True<br/>}
    
    Manager->>Manager: finalize_response
    Note over Manager: Format final output
    
    Manager-->>-Router: {<br/>  response: "Device list response",<br/>  processing_time: 14.21s<br/>}
    Note over Manager: ✅ Request processed<br/>successfully in 14.21s

    Router-->>-Client: HTTP 200 OK
    Client-->>User: Display device list with icons

    %% === TIMING BREAKDOWN ===
    Note over User,LLM: ⏱️ Timing Breakdown (Total: 14.21s)<br/><br/>• Manager routing: ~3.5s (LLM)<br/>• Tool Agent MCP init: ~1s<br/>• Tool reasoning (Iter 0): ~3s (LLM)<br/>• MCP tool execution: ~1.5s<br/>• Response synthesis (Iter 1): ~4s (LLM)<br/>• Finalize & return: <0.5s<br/><br/>🔑 Key Flows:<br/>1. StateGraph: __start__ → reason → execute → reason → END<br/>2. Tool Agent uses LangGraph for step-by-step execution<br/>3. MCP client created fresh per tool call for isolation
